<section class="wrap section--tight stack" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
  <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
  <h1 id="privacy-heading" class="hero__statement">This site doesn't collect anything from you.</h1>
</section>

<section class="wrap section--tight stack">
  <p>No cookies. No analytics. No tracking pixels. No form data. The site is static HTML hosted on Netlify, which logs incoming requests for security purposes. That is the extent of it.</p>

  <p>Fonts load from Google Fonts. Google may log your IP address when your browser fetches them. If you would rather not, browser extensions like uBlock Origin can block that.</p>

  <p>If you email me, I read your email and reply. I keep the conversation private. I do not add you to any list.</p>

  <p>External links go where they say they go. I do not track clicks.</p>

  <p style="color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: var(--space-l);">Last updated 20 May 2026.</p>
</section>
